# Triango ARM32 Bridge — optional system properties.
#
# WARNING (v0.1): the lines below are DISABLED on purpose. Advertising
# armeabi-v7a via ro.product.cpu.abilist32 lets the PackageManager *install*
# arm32 APKs, but app-level execution additionally needs zygote32 + an ART
# translation layer (roadmap v0.3). Enabling them early will produce installs
# that crash at launch. Enable only for experiments.
#
# ro.product.cpu.abilist=arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,armeabi
# ro.product.cpu.abilist32=armeabi-v7a,armeabi
# ro.product.cpu.abilist64=arm64-v8a
